!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25
skinparam BoxPadding 15
skinparam maxMessageSize 235
skinparam DefaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #555555
    ArrowFontName SansSerif
    ArrowFontSize 11
    LifeLineBorderColor #BDC3C7
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
    ParticipantBorderColor transparent
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #34495E
    ParticipantFontName SansSerif
    ParticipantFontSize 13
    ParticipantFontColor white
    BoxBorderColor transparent
    BoxFontName SansSerif
    BoxFontSize 11
    BoxFontColor #6F8592
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    BorderColor #FBC02D
    FontName SansSerif
    FontSize 11
    FontColor #424242
}

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 15
skinparam noteFontSize 13
hide footbox
title Proposed identity propagation and observation
box "Submission platform" #E7F0FF
participant "Platform API\nprincipal + workflow ID" as P
end box
box "Kubernetes cluster" #E6FCF5
participant "Kubernetes API\nresource metadata" as K
participant "Identity consumer\nexisting Karta mapping + proposed CEL" as C
end box
box "Monitoring" #F3F0FF
participant "Prometheus / Grafana\nqueries and presentation" as M
end box
legend top left
Blue: submission / Green: observation / Gray: local decisions
Illustrative proposal; CEL and canonical stamping are not deployed.
endlegend
== A. Capture identity at submission ==
[-> P: Submit as authenticated principal
P -> P: Preserve principal ID, type, namespace
P -[#4263EB]> K: Create task resources with agreed metadata
K --[#4263EB]> P: Created resource UIDs
P -->[: Return platform workload ID
note over P,K
A platform workflow need not be a Kubernetes CRD.
Service identity stays a service unless delegation is known.
end note
== B. Observe and interpret ==
C -[#0CA678]> K: List / watch scoped resources
K --[#0CA678]> C: Metadata + UIDs + owner references
C -> C: Reuse existing owner index / Karta mapping
C -> C: Evaluate configured CEL on workload and Pod
alt Candidate is consistent and from an accepted source
 C -> C: Cache namespaced principal + provenance by UID
else Missing, partial, conflicting or failed evaluation
 C -> C: Retain explicit outcome; do not invent a person
end
== C. React to change without repeated owner walks ==
K --[#0CA678]> C: Updated labels / annotations; same owner UID
C -> C: Reevaluate metadata; reuse owner relationship
note over K,C
Owner changes, recreation and watch recovery still invalidate state.
Status-only updates need not rerun identity evaluation.
end note
== D. Expose the result and its limits ==
M -[#0CA678]> C: Scrape proposed companion identity output
C --[#0CA678]> M: Identity / coverage state; existing metrics unchanged
M -> M: Join with matching workload and usage identity
M -->]: Show workload, components and submitter\nUnknown or conflict remains visible
@enduml
